OL,3,GNEWSAPM rejects drugs decriminalisation
OL,4,Aafter Swinney backs it
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said he
OL,7,Fdoes not support decriminalising drugs
OL,8,Ffor personal use, days after Scotland's
OL,9,Ffirst minister backed it.
OL,11,FAfter the latest figures showed
OL,12,FScotland's drug deaths spiked by 11%,
OL,13,FJohn Swinney said his government was in
OL,14,Ffavour of decriminalisation - meaning
OL,15,Fpeople would not face criminal
OL,16,Fpunishment for personal drug use.
OL,18,FHe said the move could be part of a
OL,19,Frange of measures which would offer
OL,20,F"more control and ability to provide
OL,21,Fgreater support to those affected by
OL,22,Fdrugs use".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
