OL,3,GNEWSAPM rejects drugs decriminalisation
OL,4,Aafter Swinney backs it
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an interview with BBC Scotland News,
OL,7,FBurnham said he would not be pursuing
OL,8,Fthe policy, but accepted there were
OL,9,Fdifferent views on the issue.
